                <div class="xt-grid3">
                    <div class="xt-card" style="padding:24px;"><div style="font-size:26px;">🏠</div><h3 style="margin:10px 0 8px;">Command-Center Dashboard</h3><p style="font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);line-height:1.6;">Live connectivity (Wi-Fi, cellular, VPN, Ethernet, metered), interface details — IPv4/IPv6, gateway, MTU — quick-launch tool tiles and an explainable weighted <strong>health score</strong>.</p></div>
