                    <div class="xt-card" style="padding:24px;"><div style="font-size:26px;">📶</div><h3 style="margin:10px 0 8px;">WiFi &amp; Signal Analyzer</h3><p style="font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);line-height:1.6;">Live band, link speed, BSSID and security, nearby network scans, and a precise room-by-room <strong>signal mapper</strong>.</p></div>
