                    <div class="xt-card" style="padding:24px;"><div style="font-size:26px;">🔮</div><h3 style="margin:10px 0 8px;">Intelligent Engine</h3><p style="font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);line-height:1.6;">Rule-based diagnostics on an <strong>Evidence → Inference → Action</strong> model with confidence levels, custom JSON rules, and professional reports (Markdown/JSON/HTML, 15 sections).</p></div>
